# v1.0.11-nodb — No-MongoDB Edition

*Released: 2026-05-19*

## Overview

This is the **nodb** variant of Blitz, designed for servers whose CPU does **not** support the AVX instruction set required by MongoDB 8.x.

All user data is stored in a local JSON file (`/etc/hysteria/users_data.json`) instead of MongoDB.

## Changes from main branch

- Replaced MongoDB storage with a thread-safe JSON file backend
- Removed `pymongo` dependency
- No MongoDB installation or AVX CPU requirement
- All APIs and CLI commands work identically to the main branch
